.nh
.TH "ORBIT" "1" "Aug 2026" "Orbit Developer Platform" "Orbit Platform Manual"

.SH NAME
.PP
orbit-admin-grant - Generate an 8-digit single-use authorization code for a new admin


.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\fBorbit admin grant  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Generates a single-use 8-digit administrative grant code (e.g. 8492-0194) bound to the
specified email address. The new admin uses this code with 'orbit admin init  --code 8492-0194'
to initialize their workstation without sending or receiving public challenge emails.


.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fB--code\fP=""
	Explicit 8-digit code (auto-generated if omitted)

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for grant

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	Output grant details as JSON

.PP
\fB--role\fP="admin"
	Role to grant (admin, maintainer, superadmin)

.PP
\fB--send\fP[=false]
	Dispatch grant code directly to recipient via SMTP

.PP
\fB-s\fP, \fB--server\fP=""
	Orbit server URL

.PP
\fB--store\fP=""
	Custom path to owner storage vault file

.PP
\fB--telegram\fP[=false]
	Dispatch grant code to Telegram Secrets topic

.PP
\fB--ttl\fP=15m0s
	Grant validity duration (e.g. 15m, 1h)


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
.PP
\fB--config\fP=""
	Custom path to Orbit CLI configuration file


.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
\fBorbit-admin(1)\fP
